cpp-pinyin2 provides the following CMake target:

    find_package(cpp-pinyin2 CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE cpp-pinyin2::cpp-pinyin2)

Dictionary resources are installed under share/cpp-pinyin2/dict. Wolf loads
its dictionary resources from the installed wolf/g2p-pinyin package.

The library uses Apache-2.0. The dictionary licenses are recorded in the
installed THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md copyright notice.
